{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Shade</strong> is an immersive, first person\u00a0<strong>psychological horror game</strong> which follows the story of Arthur Bell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day presents <strong>exploration</strong>, <strong>new tasks</strong> and duties at the manor immersing the player deep into the mysterious and intense story of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Shade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arthur Bell, a young man, takes on a maintenance and security job at an old manor deep in the countryside of Finland. What begins as a search for peace turns into an exploration of the dark side in humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features &amp; Mechanics</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dialogue with the characters that give player different answering options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Driving\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VHS graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense fear creating scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712390?t=1749017372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/b5a0517b4f528b6b5f8bc53d8496c09fea4bd0ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749017372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/6983d8e84889f3c484a99824d336a3812c9197c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749017372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/6983d8e84889f3c484a99824d336a3812c9197c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=174